, bet the underdog near kickoff (the Sunday run) (new: 0.5u through its first live season)"}, {"stars": 2, "name": "New Coach Bump", "win": "55.0%", "record": "54-37 (59.3%)", "rate": 0.5934, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Small", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u", "why": "A team that changed head coaches mid-season, in the new coach's first 3 games: back it. The market still prices the fired coach's results; teams respond to the change (small backtest of 91 bets: 0.5u until it has a live record)"}, {"stars": 3, "name": "Follow the Money Total", "win": "56.4%", "record": "137-95 (59.1%)", "rate": 0.5905, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Medium", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u (new: first live season)", "why": "On a game's total, the share of MONEY on one side is 15+ points higher than its share of TICKETS: fewer, bigger bets are there. Bet that side near kickoff (the Sunday run; needs that day's splits screenshot) (new: 0.5u through its first live season)"}, {"stars": 1, "name": "Kicking-Luck Fade", "win": "54.3%", "record": "37-26 (58.7%)", "rate": 0.5873, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Small", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u", "why": "Team kicking 1.5+ pts/game above expected this season: field-goal luck fades"}, {"stars": 3, "name": "Dog Teaser (2-team)", "win": "56.7%", "record": "378-108 (77.8% per leg)", "rate": 0.5809, "stake": 1.0, "sample": "Big", "where": "NFL card, 1u", "why": "Underdog +1.5 to +2.5 in a game totaled under 49, teased 6 pts through 3 and 7; pair two legs"}, {"stars": 2, "name": "Q Full Practice", "win": "55.1%", "record": "102-76 (57.3%)", "rate": 0.573, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Medium", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u (new: first live season)", "why": "2+ regular starters listed QUESTIONABLE but they practiced IN FULL on the final practice day, and the opponent has none: the market marks the team down for the tag, but these players almost always play. Back them (needs Friday's report, so the Saturday run) (new: 0.5u through its first live season)"}, {"stars": 2, "name": "Primetime Blowout Winner", "win": "55.0%", "record": "147-113 (56.5%)", "rate": 0.5654, "stake": 0.75, "sample": "Medium", "where": "NFL card, 0.75u", "why": "Won by 17+ in a primetime game last week (8pm ET+, Monday or Thursday), opponent didn't: back them. The market under-rates national-TV blowouts (daytime blowout winners do the opposite: 45%)"}, {"stars": 1, "name": "Revenge Over", "win": "54.7%", "record": "114-88 (56.4%)", "rate": 0.5644, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Medium", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u (new: first live season)", "why": "A starting QB faces a team he started 8+ games for, or a head coach faces a team he coached 16+ games: bet the over (new: 0.5u through its first live season)"}, {"stars": 1, "name": "OL Injury Fade", "win": "54.3%", "record": "167-135 (55.3%)", "rate": 0.553, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Big", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u", "why": "Team missing 2 offensive-line starters, opponent isn't: bet against them"}, {"stars": 1, "name": "Sharp Side", "win": "54.5%", "record": "226-183 (55.3%)", "rate": 0.5526, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Big", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u (new: first live season)", "why": "Near kickoff, Pinnacle (the book sharp bettors use) leans 0.5+ pts away from the US books, and OUR model is on the other side: the sharp money usually knows something we don't (late injury news). Bet Pinnacle's side at the US line (the Sunday run) (new: 0.5u through its first live season)"}, {"stars": 1, "name": "Healthier Team", "win": "54.0%", "record": "118-96 (55.1%)", "rate": 0.5514, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Medium", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u", "why": "One team is missing 3+ more regular starters than the other, model not on board: back the healthier team"}], "style": {"week": 12, "labels": {"run_off": "Run offense (EPA per run)", "pass_off": "Pass offense (EPA per dropback)", "run_def": "Run defense (EPA allowed per run)", "pass_def": "Pass defense (EPA allowed per dropback)", "run_rate": "Run rate, neutral situations", "pres_allowed": "Pressure allowed (sacks + h